      "summary": "Four-storey brick apartment block, one storey taller than a modest three-storey baseline. Repeated window openings, south main entrance and north service door receive automatic boarding. Flat roof, minimal floor-only interiors, graffiti panels and scattered broken furniture suggest abandonment; boarding irregularity is handled by the program.",
